      "id": "2065088918534431075",
      "text": "U.S. national park of the day: Carlsbad Caverns\n\nThis park hides most of its wonders underground. \n\nIt has more than 100 caves, including the famous Big Room, one of the largest cave chambers in North America.\n\nDescend deep below the desert and explore enormous limestone formations. \n\nStalactites, stalagmites, and underground chambers that took millions of years to form. \n\nIt feels like another world, right here in America.",
